  "content": "![https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/BzjQfCJW/images/cfe46db8bbb94021d24bcabe1e2d43b6414eebba.png](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/BzjQfCJW/images/cfe46db8bbb94021d24bcabe1e2d43b6414eebba.png)\n\n## 簡介：\n\n此模組在你的終界維度中新增了多種結構與地牢，豐富你的探索體驗。地牢內設有生怪磚與裝有戰利品的寶箱，提供資源並增加與環境互動的機會。\n\n- 喚魔者城堡\n- 堅固城堡\n- 高塔\n- 宮殿\n- 金字塔\n\n## 發掘更多精彩模組！\n\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/better-village\"\n  title=\"下載 Better Villages - 改善 Minecraft 村莊\"\n  target=\"_blank\"\n  rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n  <img alt=\"Better Villages - 強化與改善 Minecraft 村莊\"\n    src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/dGVX5JbJ/37fb0191b7d0da4db6440b5ceb705e3eea0e6e35_96.webp\" />\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/awesome-dungeon\"\n  title=\"下載 Awesome Dungeon - 在 Minecraft 中探索史詩地牢\"\n  target=\"_blank\"\n  rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n  <img alt=\"Awesome Dungeon - 全新結構與滿載戰利品的地牢\"\n    src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/ptzsjBKT/ab4804bc31f91f53a5ffadc52162f1ab4c967cb5_96.webp\" />\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/awesome-dungeon-nether\"\n  title=\"下載 Awesome Dungeon: Nether Edition - 危險的地獄地牢\"\n  target=\"_blank\"\n  rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n  <img\n    alt=\"Awesome Dungeon 地獄版 - 在致命地獄地牢中求生\"\n    src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/gW1httFP/2b963bb4be8659f1f3492100aa9c48066ab699f0_96.webp\" />\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/awesome-dungeon-edition-ocean\"\n  title=\"下載 Awesome Dungeon: Ocean Edition - 海底地牢冒險\"\n  target=\"_blank\"\n  rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n  <img\n    alt=\"Awesome Dungeon 海洋版 - 發掘沉沒地牢與寶藏\"\n    src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/hn56Bq5n/0b21eff420e6c04c3820efebd77ab9bf2ee82d76_96.webp\" />\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/disable-new-world-creation-screen\"\n  title=\"停用新世界建立畫面 - 回復經典 Minecraft 世界選單\"\n  target=\"_blank\"\n  rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n  <img\n    alt=\"停用新世界建立畫面 - 回復經典 Minecraft 世界選單\"\n    src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/hpXiq9nb/6eb794a665a467ed7307803da1e26a1316f6a0e5_96.webp\" />\n</a>\n\n喜歡這個模組？別錯過未來更新！